 "title": "The derived adjunction $D^+(j_!)\\dashv D^+(j^*)$",
 "statement": "For an open immersion $j$, the adjunction of\n[def-sfb-finite-derived-extension-by-zero-adjunction] restricts to the bounded below\nderived categories:\n\n$$\nD^+(j_!)\\dashv D^+(j^*).\n$$",
