 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "The exact functors $j_!$ and $j^*$ preserve bounded below complexes, so $D(j_!)$ and\n$D(j^*)$ restrict to $D^+(j_!)$ and $D^+(j^*)$ along the fully faithful inclusions\n$D^+\\subseteq D$. An adjunction between functors that restrict to full subcategories\nrestricts to an adjunction between the restrictions.",
